REVYTECH packaging of Ly — a lightweight TUI (ncurses-like) display manager
for FreeBSD that supports X11 and Wayland sessions.

Built from revytechinc/ly (synced with fairyglade/ly master) and wired for the
REVYTECH Wayfire stack: FreeBSD getty wrapper, OpenPAM configs, full config
tree under etc/ly, Wayfire custom session, and revytech-ly-enable to apply
gettytab/ttys integration.
